  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Xét hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>𝒟</mi></semantics></math> là tập đối xứng.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy hàm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm số chẵn.</li><li>Xét hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝒟</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></semantics></math></div>\ntức là ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝒟</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>𝒟</mi></semantics></math> là tập đối xứng.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy hàm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm số lẻ.</li></ol>",
